n_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:label_or_classification_error"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:LABEL_ERROR"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF18", "label": "Study family SF18: Fragility confirmatory: F1a usage decoupling and F1b split-half stability of residual influence", "score": 0.67, "reached_via": ["FAM:SF17 auto_related_family (record_link_related_to) FAM:SF18", "request matches RQC:RQC-011 (0.70); FAM:SF18 auto_addresses_question RQC:RQC-011"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Fragility confirmatory: F1a usage decoupling and F1b split-half stability of residual influence", "auto_outcome_status": "supported", "observed_hypothesis": "Structural influence is not reducible to usage and the usage-residual is a reproducible player property.", "observed_result": ["[APPA-039] F1a cosine R2=0.094, residual-share=0.906, CI [0.768, 0.962] PASS; Frobenius R2=0.073 share=0.927 CI [0.828, 0.965]. F1b pooled-residual rho=+0.685 p=0.0000 CI [+0.649, +0.721]; usage-partial rho=+0.557 p=0.00 [cut; read_family for the full text]", "[APPS-083] F1a cosine R2=0.099 share=0.901 CI[0.778,0.954]; frobenius R2=0.084 share=0.916. F1b pooled rho=+0.670 p=0.0000 CI[+0.636,+0.705]; partial rho=+0.560 CI[+0.496,+0.616]. F1a=CONFIRMED F1b=CONFIRMED."], "auto_failure_mechanism": "D_positive (no failure: positive result)"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:low_measurement_reliability"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:MEASURE_RELIABILITY"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF20", "label": "Study family SF20: Absence validation (structure moves under real absence; simulation tracks it)", "score": 0.67, "reached_via": ["FAM:SF17 auto_related_family (record_link_related_to) FAM:SF20", "request matches RQC:RQC-011 (0.70); FAM:SF20 auto_addresses_question RQC:RQC-011"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Absence validation (structure moves under real absence; simulation tracks it)", "auto_outcome_status": "untestable", "observed_hypothesis": "Real player absences move the association structure (V1) and the LOO simulation predicts the magnitude (V2).", "observed_result": ["[APPA-006] Gate G2 21/23 (91%) above null median; V1(a) 16/23 above own-null p95, binomial p=2.67e-16; V1(b) mean(D_real - median_null)=+0.142, CI [+0.103, +0.187].", "[APPA-007] Gate G3 Spearman +0.099. V2a Spearman +0.288, p=0.077, CI [-0.244, +0.667] FAIL; V2b partial +0.253, p=0.115, CI [-0.262, +0.615] FAIL. Diagnostics: H_code ruled out (rho=0.933); dropping 2 absorption cases rh [cut; read_family for the full text]", "[PAP-023] V1(a) 16/23 above p95 binomial p=2.67e-16; V1(b) +0.142 CI[+0.103,+0.187] CONFIRMED; V2a rho=+0.288 p=0.077 CI[-0.244,+0.667]; V2b rho=+0.253 p=0.115 NOT"]}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:small_sample"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-074", "label": "Study family SF-APPS-074: Gravity persistence: elite creator -> teammate PPP at lags 1-3", "score": 0.56, "reached_via": ["request matches RQC:RQC-102 (0.70); FAM:SF-APPS-074 auto_addresses_question RQC:RQC-102", "request matches DS:NBA_play_by_play_possessions_and_reconstructed_lineups (0.71); FAM:SF-APPS-074 auto_uses_dataset DS:NBA_play_by_play_possessions_and_reconstructed_lineups"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Gravity persistence: elite creator -> teammate PPP at lags 1-3", "auto_outcome_status": "rejected", "observed_hypothesis": "After an elite creator's signature action, teammates score more on the team's next k possessions with the same lineup on the floor.", "observed_result": "All 8 creators horizon=0. Jokic lag-1 ATT=+0.0282 CI[-0.043,+0.099] p=0.3779. CLEAN NULL on teammate PPP. Secondary: Antetokounmpo +0.075 distinct initiators over next 3 poss (perm p=0.0002, BH 0.003) ? structure not eff [cut; read_family for the full text]", "auto_failure_mechanism": "B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)", "observed_failure_evidence": "No elite creator produces a positive lineup-matched teammate-PPP lift at any lag.", "observed_sample_and_power": "Jokic lag-1 n=1880; Giannis n=1804; Doncic n=325", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_verdict": "null"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF30"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-059", "label": "Study family SF-APPS-059: Sequence-memory horizon test (per-lag vs aggregated window)", "score": 0.484, "reached_via": ["FAM:SF17 auto_related_family (record_link_related_to) FAM:SF-APPS-059", "request matches DS:NBA_play_by_play_possessions_and_reconstructed_lineups (0.71); FAM:SF-APPS-059 auto_uses_dataset DS:NBA_play_by_play_possessions_and_reconstructed_lineups"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Sequence-memory horizon test (per-lag vs aggregated window)", "auto_outcome_status": "supported", "observed_hypothesis": "Increasing prior-possession history changes the opponent's next-possession outcome after controlling for game state.", "observed_result": "Per-lag GBT AUC N=0 0.5621 -> N=1 0.5863 (d+0.0242) -> N=3 0.5907 -> N=8 0.5911. R2 0.0051 -> 0.0133. Aggregated window declines after N=1 (AUC 0.5868 -> 0.5687 at N=8). Effective horizon ~2-3 possessions.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "D_positive (no failure: positive result)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Short-memory horizon is stable OOS; almost all gain is lag-1, plateau by lag 4. Absolute AUC still only ~0.591.", "observed_sample_and_power": "n=1,024,980 possessions; time-split test 2025-26", "observed_verdict": "supported"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:small_sample"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPS-070"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF17"}]}], "n_results": 10}

